  "label": "First Responder as Hero",
  "description": "The image and text invoke the widespread cultural stereotype that first responders (firefighters, police, EMS) are heroic figures who selflessly protect the public. This stereotype is not depicted in the image but is necessary to understand why the scene is framed as 'saving a baby' and why it evokes positive emotions.",
